      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Lotus lies on the South Fork of the American River, where Class II rapids and cobble beaches shape a lively river corridor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
